          "id": "33c2de2717235be700a5269b3bd20c4aeb0362d3",
          "message": "feat(Gossip KV): Cleanup Local and AWS Deployments (#1545)\n\nCloses #1529 (P0), #1528 (P1).\r\n\r\nSummary of changes:\r\n1. Local Deployments use Terraform.\r\n2. Both Local / AWS Terraform projects have been split into separate\r\n\"infra\" and \"application\" sections because there are intervening steps\r\n(building images, etc.) that need to be done before applications can be\r\ndeployed.\r\n3. Independent documentation for each local/AWS deployment - should make\r\nit less confusing because these are expected to diverge.",
