          "message": "refactor(hydro_deploy): use `async-ssh2-russh` (instead of `libssh2` bindings), fix #1463 (#1803)\n\nFix #1463\n\nThis PR refactors the hydro deploy system to use newly created\n`async-ssh2-russh` Rust library instead of native `async-ssh2-lite`\nbindings, speeding up compile times on Windows in particular.\nhttps://github.com/hydro-project/async-ssh2-russh\n\n* Removed `async-ssh2-lite` dependencies and used `async-ssh2-russh`\ninstead.",
