          "id": "b92fcd6552d7d278ebbc14deb2f35e93f30bb636",
          "message": "test: include Hydro template sources into workspace tree and test example (#2253)\n\nSince none of the template sources rely on the template variables, we\ncan include them as-is into the workspace tree so that we get code\ncompletion and can run tests without having to manually generate the\ntemplate.\n\nAlso fixes a bug with Hydro not supporting custom `lib.path` (with\naccompanying Stageleft fix).",
