          "id": "101c7c70c3381d181241ce7c648e4f70e12f589b",
          "message": "feat(hydro_lang)!: unify `fold` API by using Stageleft properties to track commutativity and idempotence (#2405)\n\nWith support for property annotations in Stageleft, we can now eliminate\nthe `_commutative` and `_idempotent` variations of `fold` and instead\nrequire a `commutative = ...` or `idempotent = ...` annotation next to\nthe UDF. This also paves the path for configurable verification methods\nsuch as Kani.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `fold_*` variants have been removed, use `fold` with a\nproperty annotation instead",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-08T22:00:08Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/hydro-project/hydro/commit/101c7c70c3381d181241ce7c648e4f70e12f589b"
