          "id": "588e69696e6e2cab3010c8fb7ffcc919b5b14e09",
          "message": "docs(hydro_lang): add some clarification on slice scheduling (#2608)\n\nEventually, it would be nice to have `use::interval` as a slice API, but\nthis will require us to adopt DFIR loops so that the `use::interval`\ntriggers the tick even if it is not joined with any of the other inputs.",
