          "id": "a675af6236dbc0d9bac22cb08b787d5085f299b9",
          "message": "fix(hydro_lang): fix simulator hole for Stream::merge_ordered (#2755)\n\nPreviously, `Stream::merge_ordered` simply emitted a `Chain` IR node\nthat would not trigger any simulation of different interleavings. Now,\nwe use `sliced!` to ensure that the state space is explored; using\n`sliced!` does result in unnecessary states but we leave performance\noptimization to a later PR.",
