          "distinct": true,
          "id": "296a491c80546eb7f48327b48f9d50951abdf172",
          "message": "refactor(dfir_rs)!: switch `dfir_syntax!` to inline codegen, begin removing scheduled DFIR [ci-bench] (#2779)\n\nSTACK: #2776\n\nMakes `dfir_syntax!` use the inline codegen path (`InlineDfir`) and\nremoves `dfir_syntax_inline!`. This is the first major step toward\nremoving the scheduled `Dfir` runtime.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: `dfir_syntax!` now returns `InlineDfir` instead of\n`Dfir`\nBREAKING CHANGE: `dfir_syntax_inline!` and `dfir_syntax_inline_noemit!`\nare removed\nBREAKING CHANGE: `InlineDfir::run()` returns `Never` (not\n`Option<Never>` like `Dfir::run()`)\n\n### Macro and codegen\n- `dfir_syntax!` now calls `build_dfir_code_inline` instead of\n`build_dfir_code`\n- Removed `build_dfir_code` (scheduled codegen entry point) from\n`dfir_lang`\n- Removed dead scheduled codegen branch from `hydro_lang` embedded\ncompilation\n- Switched `website_playground` to `build_dfir_code_inline`\n\n### Runtime\n- `InlineDfir` now owns `InlineContext` directly, passing `&mut\nInlineContext` to the tick closure instead of capturing it (eliminates\n`Rc<Cell<TickInstant>>`)\n- Moved `Rc<DfirMetrics>` into `InlineContext`\n- Removed unused `simulation.rs` module\n\n### Tests and examples\n- Converted all viable tests and examples to `dfir_syntax!` (inline\npath)\n- Commented out tests requiring unsupported features (loop blocks,\nintra-tick cycles, `next_stratum()`) with `TODO(inline)` markers\n- Disabled examples with intra-tick cycles (reachability, naturals, rga,\nshopping, deadlock_detector)\n- Updated `print_graph` helpers to take `&DfirGraph` instead of `&Dfir`\n- Converted `metrics.rs` to inline, removed duplicate\n`metrics_inline.rs`\n\n### Benchmarks\n- Removed `fork_join` and `identity` benchmarks (pure scheduled API)\n- Disabled `reachability` benchmark (intra-tick cycles)\n- Deduplicated `_inline` benchmark variants in fan_in, fan_out,\nmicro_ops, words_diamond\n\n### Docs\n- Updated references to disabled examples (`.rs.disabled` files)\n- Added warnings to pages about strata, cyclic flows, and architecture\n(out of date)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>",
