          "message": "refactor(dfir_rs)!: remove scheduled Dfir runtime, rename Inline types (#2795)\n\nSTACK: #2782\n\nRemoves the scheduled `Dfir` runtime entirely and renames the inline\ntypes to drop the `Inline` prefix, now that they are the only\nimplementation.\n\n### Removed scheduled runtime (~2700 lines deleted)\n- `graph.rs` — `Dfir` struct and all impl blocks\n- `graph_ext.rs` — `GraphExt` trait (low-level `add_subgraph` API)\n- `port.rs` — `SendCtx`, `RecvCtx`, `SendPort`, `RecvPort`\n- `handoff/` — `VecHandoff`, `TeeingHandoff`, handoff traits\n- `input.rs`, `reactor.rs`, `subgraph.rs` — scheduler internals\n- Old `Context` struct (scheduled-path operator context)\n\n### Type renames\n- `InlineDfir` → `Dfir`\n- `InlineDfirErased` → `DfirErased`\n- `InlineContext` → `Context`\n- `InlineWakeState` → `WakeState`\n\n### Kept (now the only runtime)\n- `context.rs` — `Dfir`, `Context`, `WakeState`, `TickClosure`\n- `metrics.rs` — `DfirMetrics`, `DfirMetricsIntervals`\n- `state.rs` — `StateHandle`\n- `ticks.rs` — `TickInstant`, `TickDuration`\n- `mod.rs` — `StateLifespan` (moved here from deleted `graph.rs`), tag\ntypes\n\n### Other changes\n- Updated `hydro_lang/runtime_context.rs` to use `Context`\n- Removed `deprecated_examples/` directory\n- Removed old scheduled-path tests (`groupby`, `scheduled_test`,\n`scheduled_teeing_handoff`)\n- Updated template to use new types\n- Fixed all rustdoc links\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>",
