          "id": "bafcb57e02f0b538a2bedc9051dd36a05f3ad7e9",
          "message": "refactor(dfir_lang): replace stratification with plain topo sort, remove next_stratum (#2797)\n\nSTACK: #2795\n\nResolves #2794.\n\nReplace the SCC-based stratification pass (`find_subgraph_strata`) with\na plain\ntopological sort (`order_subgraphs`) that rejects intra-tick cycles as\nerrors.\nThis removes the concept of strata from the graph entirely.\n\nKey changes:\n\n- `flat_to_partitioned.rs`: Renamed `find_subgraph_strata` →\n`order_subgraphs`.\nReplaced `topo_sort_scc` with `topo_sort` — cycles are now rejected\ninstead\nof collapsed via SCC. Removed stratum assignment logic. Tick-boundary\nedges\nare now identified by topo sort position instead of stratum comparison.\nRemoved `separate_external_inputs` (was a stratum-0 concept). Source\noperators\n  now stay in their natural subgraph; the topo sort handles ordering.\n\n- `meta_graph.rs` (DfirGraph struct): Removed `subgraph_stratum` and\n`subgraph_laziness` fields. Added `handoff_delay_type` field to track\nwhich\nhandoff nodes are tick-boundary back-edges (Tick/TickLazy). Removed\nmethods:\n  `subgraph_stratum()`, `set_subgraph_stratum()`, `max_stratum()`,\n  `subgraph_laziness()`, `set_subgraph_laziness()`. Added methods:\n  `handoff_delay_type()`, `set_handoff_delay_type()`.\n\n- `meta_graph.rs` (as_code): Updated topo sort to use\n`handoff_delay_type()`\ninstead of comparing strata. Laziness is now determined by checking if\nthe\n  delay type is `TickLazy` instead of querying `subgraph_laziness()`.\n\n- `graph_write.rs`: Removed stratum parameter from\n`write_subgraph_start()`.\n  Subgraph labels in mermaid/dot output no longer show stratum numbers.\n\n- `mod.rs`: Removed `validate_graph` function — its cycle check is now\n  subsumed by `order_subgraphs`, and its `loop {}` rejection moved to\n  `build_dfir_code` (with a TODO to find a better home).\n\n- Removed `next_stratum` operator entirely (was just an identity op with\n  `DelayType::Stratum`; ordering is now handled by the topo sort).\n\n- `dfir_macro/src/lib.rs`: `dfir_parser!` now gracefully handles cycle\nerrors\n  from `partition_graph` instead of panicking.\n\n- Added `Serialize`/`Deserialize` derives to `DelayType` (needed for the\nnew\n  `handoff_delay_type` field on `DfirGraph`).\n\n- Added TODO comment on intermediate identity subgraph injection noting\nit\n  should be removed in the future.\n\n- ~180 snapshot files updated (stratum labels removed from graph\nvisualizations,\nsome subgraph structures simplified due to `separate_external_inputs`\nremoval).\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>",
