          "id": "ba2eee3633034e18ffb619954d3277ce69c9344b",
          "message": "feat(hydro_lang): add broadcast_closed for fixed-membership clusters (#2807)\n\nAdds `Stream::broadcast_closed`, a deterministic alternative to\n`broadcast` for clusters with fixed deploy-time membership.\n\nUnlike `broadcast`, this does not require a `NonDet` guard — the\nmembership set is obtained via `source_iter` over `ClusterIds`,\nproducing a `Bounded` stream. The cross-product of data × members is\nfully deterministic.\n\nUseful for prototyping and testing with fixed-size clusters.\n\nDepends on #2778 (mixed-boundedness `cross_product`).\n\nCloses #2803\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Joe Hellerstein <jmhwork@amazon.com>\nCo-authored-by: copilot-swe-agent[bot] <198982749+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: jhellerstein <384577+jhellerstein@users.noreply.github.com>",
