          "id": "e57d42befe42ad97b9cee0cbd072274a72184f41",
          "message": "refactor(dfir_lang): convert missed join_multiset_half to use local variables (#2834)\n\ninstead of the state API\n\nReplaced the state API pattern (`add_state(RefCell::new(...))`,\n`state_ref_unchecked`,\n`set_state_lifespan_hook`) with plain local `let mut` variables and\n`write_tick_end`\nclearing, matching the conversion done to all other operators in commit\n5efd2a83.\n\nChanges:\n- Build state: `let mut build: FxHashMap<_, Vec<_>>` instead of\n`add_state(RefCell::new(FxHashMap::default()))`\n- Probe state: `let mut probe: Vec<_>` instead of\n`add_state(RefCell::new(Vec::new()))`\n- Removed all `unsafe { context.state_ref_unchecked(...).borrow_mut() }`\nblocks\n- Replaced `write_prologue_after` with `set_state_lifespan_hook` by\n`write_tick_end` with `.clear()` calls\n- Removed unused `df_ident` and `work_fn` from the destructured\n`WriteContextArgs`\n- Removed `probe_borrow`/`build_borrow` intermediate idents (now access\nstate directly)\n\nAll 6 existing tests pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>",
