          "id": "ebfa2adb00153bc26af5cf0c9eb14bfed6eb5188",
          "message": "refactor(dfir_rs)!: remove SubgraphTag, LoopTag, slot_vec (#2812)\n\nSTACK: #2811 #2810\n\nRemove `SubgraphTag`, `LoopTag`, and the corresponding\n`SubgraphId`/`LoopId` type aliases from `dfir_rs::scheduled`.\n\nAlso remove the now-unused `slot_vec` utility module (`SlotVec`,\n`SecondarySlotVec`, `Key`) — its only consumers were the removed ID\ntypes and the `SecondarySlotVec` usage replaced by\n`slotmap::SecondaryMap` in #2810.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: removes `SubgraphTag`, `LoopTag`, and `SlotVec`\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>",
