          "id": "d4ff79f02f6ab1981f671e364e02c089a4990735",
          "message": "feat(hydro_lang/sim)!: Make `source_interval` emit `()` and add `current_tick_instant` (#2867)\n\n…for wall-clock time\n\naddresses #2393 \n\nChanged `source_interval` and `source_interval_delayed` to:\n- Emit `()` instead of `tokio::time::Instant`\n- Remove the `NonDet` parameter (timing non-determinism is captured by\n`AtLeastOnce` downstream)\n\nAdded `current_tick_instant(&self, _nondet: NonDet)` which returns a\n`Singleton<tokio::time::Instant, Tick<Self>, Bounded>` — the explicit,\n`NonDet`-gated API for reading wall-clock time in a tick.\n\nUpdated all callers in hydro_lang, hydro_std, and hydro_test.\n\n## Breaking Changes\n\n- `source_interval` and `source_interval_delayed` now emit `()` instead\nof `tokio::time::Instant`\n- `source_interval` and `source_interval_delayed` no longer take a\n`NonDet` parameter\n- To get the current wall-clock time in a tick, use the new\n`current_tick_instant` API (which requires `NonDet`)\n\nCo-authored-by: Infinity 🤖 <infinity@hydro.run>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-15T17:22:07Z",
          "url": "https://github.com/hydro-project/hydro/commit/d4ff79f02f6ab1981f671e364e02c089a4990735"
