          "id": "7ba6ce0e76eaba0d0dff36a6eb761d72327030fd",
          "message": "docs: Fix rustdoc links on case-insensitive filesystems (#3087)\n\n## Summary\n- require exact directory-entry casing before treating a rustdoc path\nsegment as a module\n- prevent item names such as `Stream` from accidentally matching\nlowercase module directories on case-insensitive filesystems\n\n## Testing\n- `cargo +1.96.0 doc --no-deps --all-features`\n- `CI=true NO_COLOR=1 npm run build` (from `docs/`)\n\nCo-authored-by: Joe Hellerstein <jmhwork@amazon.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T01:35:31Z",
